  "body_html": "<h1>Game Tree</h1>\n<p>The tree of a finite perfect-information extensive game is a finite connected\ndirected acyclic graph with a distinguished origin $\\theta$. Every non-origin node\nhas a unique predecessor, and iterating predecessors eventually reaches $\\theta$.</p>\n<p>Terminal nodes are those with no successors. Decision positions are nonterminal\nnodes. Each decision position has a nonempty successor set.</p>",
